        "Description": "Good day, 47\r\rAfter Dubai, the trail went cold until now. Fresh intelligence has emerged at Thornbridge Manor. Alexa Carlisle believes her brother was murdered and has hired a private investigator to uncover the truth. What she does not realize is that her brother was a crucial link in our investigation into the darker dealings of the Sheikh of Dubai and his allies.\r\rThe client requests we eliminate the killer. Also Eliminate the detective to prevent any news of coming out.\r\rGood Hunting.",
